div.p:
Page 60. The second paragraph was printed so as to look approximately like the following: “[ . . . ] II Sam. 
                  1 : 2–6;

                  2 : 8–12.”, namely, with equal space on either side of the colon in the first instance and unequal spaces in the second instance. This transcription makes it equal spaces, U+200A (hair space).
